Changed: The solution argument of IBTK::FACPreconditionerStrategy::computeResidual() and the residual argument of smoothError() and solveCoarsestLevel() are non-const. This is part of a fix to IBTK::FACPreconditioner V-cycles with presmoothing, which solve each coarse-level correction equation with the composite-grid residual.
